  "prefLabel": "Lot 7202.42 Wager",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.42 “Wager” means “wager” as defined in RSA 287-D:1, XIV, namely “a monetary agreement between 2 or more persons that a sum of money or other valuable thing shall be paid to one of them on the happening or not happening of an uncertain event. Wager may be used synonymously with the term ‘bet.’”\n\nSource. #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25; ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.30)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot7200.html"
